Package: rmet
Type: Package
Title: Download and Read Brazilian Meteorological Data from INMET
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Rodrigo Fonseca", "Villa",
                  email = "rodrigo03.villa@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-2938-2270"))
Description: Automates the download and processing of historical hourly
    weather data from automatic stations of the Brazilian National Institute
    of Meteorology (INMET). It provides the official station catalogue with
    an offline snapshot and nearest-station search, validated and resumable
    downloads that detect updated archives, and a fast parser for the
    formatting and encoding inconsistencies of raw CSV files across years. It
    returns analysis-ready data frames with standardized column names and UTC
    timestamps. It flags implausible values with transparent quality-control
    checks, reports data completeness, and builds daily summaries in each
    station's local time with explicit rules for incomplete days. Data are
    retrieved from <https://portal.inmet.gov.br/dadoshistoricos> and
    <https://apitempo.inmet.gov.br/estacoes/T>.
